     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ehealth-conditions</b></p><a name=\"ehealth-conditions\"> </a><a name=\"hcehealth-conditions\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html\"><code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.4</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-ALAL03\">ALAL03</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Psykiske lidelser og adfærdsmæssige forstyrrelser</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DE10\">DE10</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Type 1-diabetes</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DE11\">DE11</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Type 2-diabetes</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DF00\">DF00</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Demens ved Alzheimers sygdom</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DF10\">DF10</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Psykiske lidelser og adfærdsmæssige forstyrrelser forårsaget af brug af alkohol</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DF20\">DF20</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Skizofreni</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DF30\">DF30</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Manisk enkeltepisode</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DF320\">DF320</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Depressiv enkeltepisode af lettere grad</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4-DF321\"